{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"一、二十有七年。春，公如齊。公至自齊，居于運。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"二、夏四月，吳弒其君僚。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"三、楚殺其大夫郤宛。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"四、秋，晉士鞅、宋樂祁犁、衞北宮喜、曹人、邾婁人、滕人會于扈。冬十月，曹伯午卒。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"五、邾婁快來奔。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"邾婁快者何？邾婁之大夫也。邾婁無大夫，此何以書？以近書也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_207_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_207","textTraditional":"六、公如齊，公至自齊，居于運。","sentenceOrder":7}],"overrides":{}}